stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: The production alias controls the release
accDescr: A built and validated version receives a canary share through the alias. Alarms roll back, successful observation moves all traffic to the new version.
state "Build and test v2" as Build
state "Alias: 100% v1" as Old
state "Pre-traffic validation" as Validate
state "Alias: 90% v1 / 10% v2" as Canary
state "Alias: 100% v2" as New
Build --> Validate: Publish v2
Old --> Validate: Retain v1 as rollback target
Validate --> Canary: Validation succeeds
Validate --> Old: Validation fails
Canary --> Old: Alarm or failed validation
Canary --> New: Observation interval succeeds
note right of Canary
 API Gateway invokes the alias.
 Percentages illustrate a canary policy.
end note
